83133323430343536","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"相遇曹操","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"项羽：你要千秋业，我要万家灯，注定殊途。","hasText":true,"duration":6.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/068976953A7E71000183133323430343536.mp3"},{"id":"068116953A7E81000183130363133343536","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"相遇后羿","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"项羽：人鬼毕竟殊途，能听见她祝念平安的歌声，就足矣。","hasText":true,"duration":7.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/068116953A7E81000183130363133343536.mp3"},{"id":"067556953A7E61000183135363636313838","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"相遇曹操","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"项羽：何人擅扰阴阳边界，还不速速退离！","hasText":true,"duration":5.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/067556953A7E61000183135363636313838.mp3"},{"id":"066236953A7E41000183738353737363336","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"死亡","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"原来……我早已回不去了。","hasText":true,"duration":5.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/066236953A7E41000183738353737363336.mp3"},{"id":"063416953A7E41000183130373831373834","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"移动喊话7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"他们的轮回里，该是第几度荣枯？","hasText":true,"duration":6.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/063416953A7E41000183130373831373834.mp3"},{"id":"064236953A7E41000183930313733323030","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"击杀","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"九冥路窄，吾刃倒宽。","hasText":true,"duration":6.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/064236953A7E41000183930313733323030.mp3"},{"id":"068396953A7E41000183138323134383135","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"挑衅","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"群魔一时无首，小鬼也敢称霸王。","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/068396953A7E41000183138323134383135.mp3"},{"id":"066316953A7E21000183531303731323431","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"移动喊话2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"刀折旗未折，身销志不销。","hasText":true,"duration":5.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/066316953A7E21000183531303731323431.mp3"},{"id":"060186953A7E31000183337313731373736","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"移动喊话5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"忠骨作阶，绝断幽途；孤魂为炬，照护阳关。","hasText":true,"duration":8.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/060186953A7E31000183337313731373736.mp3"},{"id":"061256953A7E21000183930353230333634","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"移动喊话1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"亡者成煞，生者铸戈，两界动乱皆从冥府起。","hasText":true,"duration":7.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/061256953A7E21000183930353230333634.mp3"},{"id":"069526953A7E21000183738333133333336","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"移动喊话3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"那年歃血同征鬼门关，千人去，无人还。","hasText":true,"duration":7.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/069526953A7E21000183738333133333336.mp3"},{"id":"067006953A7E21000183636353732313539","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"大厅喊话3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"纵余半截残刃，犹镇滔滔鬼潮！","hasText":true,"duration":12.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/067006953A7E21000183636353732313539.mp3"},{"id":"060316953A7E31000183830383133383037","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"移动喊话6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"望乡台上无乡可望，奈何桥前谁叹奈何。","hasText":true,"duration":8.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/060316953A7E31000183830383133383037.mp3"},{"id":"067046953A7E31000183334383730333431","heroId":"219","skinId":"1678","skinName":"九幽镇关","title":"移动喊话4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"风中传来熟悉乡曲，可是她又在三更灯影里遥问归期？","hasText":true,"duration":9.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/219/067046953A7E31000183334383730333431.mp3"},{